    "challenge": "Federal contracts include 100-leaf books and distribution to specific constituencies/LGAs (e.g., \"SUPPLY AND DISTRIBUTION\" titles), while Oyo contracts are procurement-only for 60/80 leaves with massive lot sizes (200k+). Federal lot sizes are 8k–74k, contract years differ (2023–2024 vs 2022 only), and some federal titles specify customization and delivery scope not captured in leaf count alone. These factors constitute legitimate innocent explanations for the observed gap.",
    "disposition": "downgrade"
  }
]

